{"articleNo":"94188","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=94188&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[LINC사업단]학생/CEO 멘토/멘티 사업 신청 안내(기간연장)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.10.31","hit":"3714","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">학생/CEO 멘토/멘티 사업 신청 안내(기간연장)</span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼모음T; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼모음T; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼모음T\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼모음T; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼모음T; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼모음T\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 신청대상 : 본교 3학년 ~ 4학년 재학생(응용수학과 제외)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: -10pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼모음T; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼모음T; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼모음T\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 신청방법 : 첨부.(신청서) 사업단으로 제출(방문, 메일, Fax 가능)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: -10pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼모음T; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼모음T; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼모음T\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 신청기한 :</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼모음T; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt;